  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Our Phase 1 Programme is focused on meeting the needs of older people, people with disabilities and other vulnerable groups in response to the Myanmar Earthquake. The overall goal is to support the resilience and recovery of crisis-affected communities by improving access to essential services, restoring dignity, and fostering inclusive, gender- and disability-sensitive community participation.</narrative>
